# Vercel excludes files with gitignore-style patterns. An unanchored directory
# name matches that directory at ANY depth, which silently removed the browser
# SDK bundle at vendor/supabase/sdk.js from production and broke every Supabase
# call (login showed "admin account could not be verified"). Anchor every
# backend-only directory to the repository root and keep vendor/** deployed.
/node_modules
/tests
/functions
/tools
/supabase
/docs
/demo
/playwright-report
/test-results
/firebase.json
/firestore.rules
/firestore.indexes.json
/database.rules.json
/database.rules.v2.draft.json
*.md
/AUDIT-*.md
/LIGHTENING-*.md
/.git
/.github
/assets/sky
/assets/fonts/*.ttf
